    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Inactive draft \u2014 issue #26\nSet apiKey in Configuration once; HTTP nodes reuse it as X-API-Key.\nReview Configuration and README.md before manual execution.\nFor daily automation publish ONLY daily-pipeline.json.\nStandalone drafts have no cross-workflow dependency checks.\nWaiting purchases remain visible in Check purchases output.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "91d4c39a-0b98-5ee1-b18a-476e9a8acaa7",
